Do not build the (uninstalled) apps helper library when all applications
are disabled; it drags in optional dependencies (libtiff, libevent)
found on the build host.

Index: src/apps/meson.build
--- src/apps/meson.build.orig
+++ src/apps/meson.build
@@ -3,6 +3,11 @@
 opt_cam = get_option('cam')
 opt_lc_compliance = get_option('lc-compliance')
 
+if not opt_cam.allowed() and not opt_lc_compliance.allowed() and \
+   not get_option('qcam').allowed()
+    subdir_done()
+endif
+
 # libevent is needed by cam and lc-compliance. As they are both feature options,
 # they can't be combined with simple boolean logic.
 libevent = dependency('libevent_pthreads', required : opt_cam)
